*E_NAME		"Cave Guard"

*E_CHAT		"It was called Beehive Cave before,  but now it turned into monsters' denbecause the wall leading to the     Sanctuary of Darkness broke down,   through which evil spirit prevailed."
*E_CHAT		"This is Beehive Cave. Only trained  warriors can pass here."
*E_CHAT		"You can go to the Mushroom Cave in  the land of Tempskron, which is alsolinked to the Santuary of Darkness."
*E_CHAT		"There is a passage deep down in the cave, which leads to the Santuary ofDarkness. Evil spirit reigns over   the cave. I advise you to stay away."
